    "summary": "When you pick this unit to fight in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), you may roll one D6 as a **[psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities)** if it is free of **battle-shock**. A 1 **battle-shocks** the unit. Taking the roll also lets the unit reroll melee **wound rolls** of 1 and gives its melee attacks [[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic). This psychic ability can be used once each phase.",
